OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Frain through the evening. Becoming
OL,7,Fdrier during the early hours of Monday
OL,8,Fmorning with clear spells, turning
OL,9,Fcold with a local grass frost. Winds
OL,10,Fbecoming strong, then easing toward
OL,11,Fdawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FA largely dry and bright
OL,14,Fstart, with plenty of sunny spells.
OL,15,FCloud increasing through the
OL,16,Fafternoon. Windy, with outbreaks of
OL,17,Fheavy and persistent rain into the
OL,18,Fevening. Chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
