OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fand unsettled, with spells of rain and
OL,7,Fstrong winds at times Tuesday to
OL,8,FThursday. Generally mild, especially
OL,9,Fby night.
